  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Let the solution curve <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></math> of the differential equation&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>5</mn></msup><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mfenced></mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>6</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msup></mfrac><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>exp</mi><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><msqrt><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>6</mn></msup></msqrt></mfrac></math>&nbsp;pass through the origin. Then&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></math>&nbsp;is equal to:</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
